abstract: >-
  Six questions asked in a fixed order, each one a gate that an agent proposal must
  pass before it ships: Justify, Grade, Limit, Build, Prove, Run. Includes the
  Rubric Test, the four-tier risk ladder, the three-pens model of argument
  authority, artifact templates, a reference tool boundary, and an eval harness.
